      "text": "let me tell you where I've got to it's hard to say. Perimenopausal symptoms is one possibility and a thyroid problem another and I'd rather not commit yet i think blood tests makes sense here for irregular periods i want a bone density scan done that's for menopause layers of clothing a fan by the bed and cutting down on caffeine and spicy food can help the flushes"
